---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Skills
intro: Grouped by what the work actually is, with honest levels rather than percentage bars.
description: GIS skills — ArcGIS Pro and Online, Python and ArcPy automation, spatial ETL, network analysis, geodatabase management, and cartographic production.
permalink: /skills/index.html
---

<div class="container section">

  {# The level key. Levels are words, not bars — a bar implies a precision that
     does not exist, and a percentage is not something anyone can verify. #}
  <div class="level-key">
    <dl>
      <dt><span class="skill-level skill-level--advanced">Advanced</span></dt>
      <dd>Core to my day-to-day work; I lead on it.</dd>
      <dt><span class="skill-level skill-level--comfortable">Comfortable</span></dt>
      <dd>Used regularly on delivered projects.</dd>
      <dt><span class="skill-level skill-level--developing">Developing</span></dt>
      <dd>Working knowledge, still building depth.</dd>
      <dt><span class="skill-level skill-level--exploring">Exploring</span></dt>
      <dd>Learning it now.</dd>
    </dl>
  </div>

  <div class="skill-groups">
    {% for group in skillGroups %}
      <section class="skill-group" aria-labelledby="skills-{{ group.group | handle }}">
        <h2 id="skills-{{ group.group | handle }}" style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:var(--step-1)">
          {{ group.group }}
        </h2>
        <ul class="skill-list">
          {% for skill in group.skills %}
            <li>
              <div class="skill-row">
                <span class="skill-name">{{ skill.name }}</span>
                <span class="skill-level skill-level--{{ skill.level | handle }}">{{ skill.level }}</span>
              </div>
              {% if skill.note %}<span class="skill-link">{{ skill.note }}</span>{% endif %}
              {% if skill.project %}
                <span class="skill-link">Applied in
                  <a href="{{ skill.project | url }}">{{ skill.projectName }}</a>
                </span>
              {% endif %}
            </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </section>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <div class="aside-card" style="margin-top:var(--space-xl)">
    <h2 style="font-size:var(--step-1)">Standards &amp; delivery</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom:0;color:var(--ink-soft)">
      Deliverables produced to client and federal standards, including Section 508
      accessibility compliance and FHWA requirements, with written workflow
      documentation so the work can be picked up by someone else.
    </p>
  </div>

</div>

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Need one of these on a project?</h2>
    <p>{{ site.availability }}.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn--on-dark" href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">Get in touch</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost-on-dark" href="{{ '/projects/' | url }}">See the work</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
